      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100740020007400680069007300200072006100740065002C0020004900200077006F006E2019007400200068006100760065002000610020007400650061006D0020006F006600200074006800650020007300740072006F006E0067006500730074000A004B0061006B0075006E0061002E002E002E001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll just have a team of Beedrill!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006C006C0020006A00750073007400200068006100760065002000610020007400650061006D0020006F00660020004200650065006400720069006C006C0021001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I guess that’s fine though. Bug Pokémon evolve\nsuper early. There’s no helping it.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It just means I need to treasure the brief time I\nget to spend with my lovely Kakuna.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pokémon don’t usually evolve on their own...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200064006F006E2019007400200075007300750061006C006C0079002000650076006F006C007600650020006F006E0020007400680065006900720020006F0077006E002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What? You have to view your party Pokémon and\nselect “Evolve” to trigger their Evolution?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAre you saying my Kakuna are extra special, then?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 147
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Wow. I’m happy to hear that!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nYou know, I love Kakuna. But Beedrill are cool too,\naren’t they... How am I supposed to choose?!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
